/ The list beside the map: the Drucksachen naming a place in view, below what
/ the chosen time range covers. Its links leave the frame (target _top on the
/ frame), except the paging, which stays.
turbo-frame#map-documents
  h2.h5.mb-1 Im Kartenausschnitt
  p.small.text-secondary.mb-2
    => MapQuery::RANGE_HINTS[@query.range]
    - if @documents.total_count.zero?
      | Keine Drucksache nennt hier einen Ort.
    - else
      = "#{number_with_delimiter(@documents.total_count)} #{@documents.total_count == 1 ? 'Drucksache nennt' : 'Drucksachen nennen'} hier einen Ort, die zuletzt beratenen zuerst."

  - if @documents.any?
    .list-group.list-group-flush
      - @documents.each do |document|
        = render 'documents/item', document:, compact: false

    - if @documents.total_pages > 1
      nav.d-flex.justify-content-between.align-items-center.mt-3 aria-label='Seiten'
        = link_to_prev_page @documents, 'Neuere', class: 'btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary', data: { turbo_frame: 'map-documents' }
        span.small.text-secondary= "Seite #{@documents.current_page} von #{@documents.total_pages}"
        = link_to_next_page @documents, 'Ältere', class: 'btn btn-sm btn-outline-secondary', data: { turbo_frame: 'map-documents' }
